<span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">I hope you’re having a great week! I’m following up on my previous communications.<br />
<br />
I would love the opportunity to grab 20-30 minutes of your time to learn more about your organization, tell you a little bit more about Insperity, and see if there’s anything we can do to help contribute to your continued success.<br />
<br />
Please let me know what times are most convenient for you this week. Thank you, and I look forward to hearing back from you.<br />
<br />
Also, I hope you had a chance to read the e-book I sent you and it provided some helpful insight.&nbsp;<br />
